            "title": "Question: Infinite loop",
            "id": 126896,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Skąd wiemy, że ta pętla będzie wykonywać swój kod w kółko już zawsze?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Cheat code activated&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Cheat code activated\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Cheat code activated\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Cheat code activated\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ponieważ warunek pozostaje na zawsze ustawiony na <code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ponieważ warunek pozostaje na zawsze <code>false</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ponieważ warunek zmienia się z <code>false</code> na <code>true</code> na zawsze</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ponieważ warunek pozostaje na zawsze ustawiony na <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Code block",
            "id": 126897,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaki kod pętla while wykonuje w kółko?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isOn = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Warming up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Cooling down&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Warming up\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Warming up\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Warming up\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>print(\"Warming up\");</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>var isOn = false;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(\"Cooling down\");</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>print(\"Warming up\");</code>.</p></body></html>"
